<title>INDONESIA: Charoen 9-mth net up to 47.23 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Charoen 9-mth net up to 47.23 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   47.23 vs 40.87</p>
<p>    Net sales			   929.59 vs 679.54</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  62.90 vs 72.98</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    67.92 vs 56.53</p>
<p>    Earnings per share		  419 vs 384</p>
<p>Note: PT Charoen Pokphand Indonesia, a member of the Charoen Pokphand Group, is a manufacturer of poultry feed.</p>
</text>
